[{"client_msg_id":"21fe9ef0-af54-4311-8513-6464cdb7c7aa","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"いいね、というかFeliCaも(一応は)NFCの仲間だし、ちゃんと対応している端末ならできてほしいよね\nそしてVISAのは、いまだとGoogle Pay経由での設定もありえるので、そろそろ慣れてほしいね","ts":"1625747859.255500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=8C"}]},{"client_msg_id":"68d7a1b5-2d8b-4158-b869-3012d3a8bbb6","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"これどうなるかな\n\u003chttps://www.itmedia.co.jp/mobile/articles/2107/07/news072.html|https://www.itmedia.co.jp/mobile/articles/2107/07/news072.html\u003e","ts":"1625747770.254100","attachments":[{"fallback":"ITmedia Mobile: FeliCaに対応、スマホが決済端末になる「Tap on Mobile」の可能性","id":1,"title":"FeliCaに対応、スマホが決済端末になる「Tap on Mobile」の可能性","title_link":"https://www.itmedia.co.jp/mobile/articles/2107/07/news072.html","text":"スマートフォンを決済端末にして手軽にキャッシュレスを導入できる「Tap on Mobile」。海外ではNFC対応でクレジットカードのタッチ決済が可能だが、日本では独自にFeliCaを搭載。幾つかの店舗で実証実験を行っているが、店舗側の反応は良好だという。","image_url":"https://image.itmedia.co.jp/mobile/articles/2107/07/cover_news072.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"ITmedia Mobile","service_icon":"https://www.itmedia.co.jp/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://www.itmedia.co.jp/mobile/articles/2107/07/news072.html","original_url":"https://www.itmedia.co.jp/mobile/articles/2107/07/news072.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xqL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"51bd2c15-30b9-472b-b886-5d986006127a","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"VISAタッチは慣れてない店員だと電子マネーと勘違いしてキャンセルしてくるので気をつけないといけない。","ts":"1625747752.253700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Hvr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d6f56ce3-4986-4ea5-bb96-be942b07372d","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"カード自体を見せるのは好きじゃないので、程度なんだよな\nその意味で最終的にVISAとかのタッチがいいんだろうけど","ts":"1625747611.251500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HKXw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"60db2d73-fcf7-4a37-a259-5db92cda854f","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"Suicaつかえない\nクレジットカードもだめ\nなときの現金以外の最終手段","ts":"1625747535.250700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"J4GTT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"546f09dc-e24c-4a99-9922-84f2aa8d6f77","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"ちょうどあの時期やわらか銀行系の現場でPayPayないとオフィスグリコ買えないトラップが発生してなぁ","ts":"1625747526.250400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WavHt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"404d146e-0ed0-4346-917f-2937abe3b8d8","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"基本的にキャンペーン時以外は使うことないですね。松屋とか交通系ICカードとQR決済しか対応していない場合は仕方なく使いますけど。","ts":"1625747521.250000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"m6RC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0d3dac00-6885-403d-a317-fe174c29e3e3","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"PayPay登録すらしてない、する気もないけど","ts":"1625747476.247800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E9FV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"01c35622-c50f-4692-bf02-89e2ba337efd","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"正直中国の需要と噛み合っただけじゃないのか","ts":"1625747455.247300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6cNRL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ada04e04-d180-421d-9c01-b99841361ec0","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"個人送金はリアルタイムだからあんまり不安ないけど","ts":"1625747447.247100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Jrw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b863d91b-88a6-4a27-a15a-11249beaca80","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"キャッシュレスなぁ、クレジットカードにアレをかませる意味がわからなくてな・・・","ts":"1625747431.246400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j3U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"79244d59-342a-489f-b42b-1b57c0595bba","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"どちらにしろpringの買収話が本当なら再度ばら撒きキャンペーンで旨みを味わえるかもしれませんよ。最近シブチンだったので。","ts":"1625747377.244500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KtGL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4a7f22d5-2921-4df9-b404-944fe9e333b6","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ハードカレンシー以上にグローバルマネーになったドルかわいそうな面もあるな","ts":"1625747294.243400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"10HF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eb7b6292-791d-43f3-91af-f63af6779f24","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"PayPay、店提示のQRを読む方しか使ったことない。ユーザーのQR読む設備持ってる店なら大抵クレカが使えるので。\nしかし、ユーザーが金額を入力するのはなんとも不安になる。","ts":"1625747286.243100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9Gwk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3abdc80a-5096-4ee1-9611-5c64319db8b0","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"カードに社会的な信用がくっついてるらしく\n20ドル以上の買い物を現金ですると怪しいやつ扱いされるそうな","ts":"1625747256.242400","edited":{"user":"U782D5DF1","ts":"1625747271.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WaL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dde70b42-d2a4-489f-8672-03534cb7f871","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"色んな意味でインセンティブ大事だな","ts":"1625747242.242000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wnu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0eceab79-c88b-45cd-a0a5-1c1b460e7af5","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ハードカレンシーある国だとあまりその意味で効果的ではないんだよね(国を信頼する限りにおいて)","ts":"1625747232.241300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PZe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"24104726-37ad-4571-bc55-0c29867e99fb","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"もともと暗号資産とかもそうなんだけど、自国の発行通貨がアテにならないときは電子決済が有効だったり\nアフリカとかでもケータイのSMSで決済やりとりあるみたいだし","ts":"1625747210.240300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zpQh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"183c01f2-9463-478e-b065-76ab2ae68606","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"米国でカードが強いのは基軸通貨なんで贋札作った時の利益がデカイってのと","ts":"1625747206.240000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ysfYv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1d619b37-928a-4364-9389-5019a10e7538","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"\u0026gt;運転手が100元札を受け取った後、手元で偽札にすり替えた上で、「これは偽札なので他の札を。」などと言って正規の札と引き替えに偽札を渡す手口です。酒席から帰宅した方が当日ATMからおろしたばかりの100元札をタクシー運転手に渡したところ偽札だと言われ、別の100元札を渡したところ、これも偽物だと言われて何枚も取っかえ引っかえ渡し、結局10枚とも偽札にすり替えられてしまったという話もあります。","ts":"1625747184.239100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Wk5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a478e049-6e53-44f2-a444-7b4bb1ec298a","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"日本でキャッシュレスがそこまでもてはやされないのは日本円の質が高すぎるのが原因という話もどこかで聞いたな","ts":"1625747163.237700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IhO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"57b67787-3c00-4c8d-91e8-2aaf41cac343","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"手元でごまかせないし、不正通貨が流通するわけないという意味ではそうですねえ","ts":"1625747158.237200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SWs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e487f124-1f25-4b36-a724-12a1116bae7d","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"そういう環境なのでキャッシュレスの方が信用があるのですよ・・・","ts":"1625747127.235700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JMPm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7ed932f4-20e3-461a-bf77-1482b09305a3","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"\u0026gt; 元の信頼性\nげん、でも、もとでも意味が通るな","ts":"1625747115.235300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tashikani","count":1,"users":