delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=iUa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c3498c23-cf63-4fc7-b43c-8f6678072318","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あれかな、店側アプリに状態表示くらいは出るのかな?","ts":"1625746151.217400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z8a"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1a4f09dd-55bd-41e7-b16c-a24a8c017126","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"利用者ががカメラで読むやつだと確かに","ts":"1625746137.217000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IvgA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3fe47d34-2459-4b2b-8c5a-7b9ea4fb0b91","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"店提示のQRで支払いしたことまだないなあ\n大概POSでのスキャン側...\n中国の露天とかどうしてたんだろうね?","ts":"1625746136.216900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Jy5J0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b266d178-533c-4c2d-96c3-e421d58feb8e","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"そう言えば QR で PayPay で払う時って、あれスマホの画面を店員が目視でしか確認してないよね。PayPay と画面がソックリだけど実際には支払いをしない偽アプリとかって出てきちゃったりしないんだろうか。QR から店情報を引き出すのに特別な認証が必要になったりとかしてるのかな","ts":"1625746081.215600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QI1U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1862547e-7af2-4f9e-a60b-68ab5650ea48","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"なおCoke-on Pay(コカコーラの自販機の電子買い)に使えるしQRやバーコードじゃないので、その意味で利用ってのが大半だな","ts":"1625745921.214000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3W1Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"335b42d6-7650-4fae-8b10-4ba48c36cff2","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"基本、dポイント/楽天ポイントの消費用だな","ts":"1625745878.213100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"heIzG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"13648e65-eeda-438b-a502-281d79ce0f11","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"面倒だけど、カードを普通にやるよりは手軽だからまあいいか(でも積極的には使ってない)\nくらいだな...","ts":"1625745863.212700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PjYBF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"55698a68-3f2a-4987-9432-109dfd1800e6","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"正直QRコードで決済とかやりたくないわ・・・","ts":"1625745294.212000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"roQEH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"895c01e4-13a4-491d-95e8-19b9ccf52c8c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ぼっちなので送金まだ(たぶん)したことないな...","ts":"1625745225.211500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PIAw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d01c3f74-c5e6-4527-b5e1-e23c2a5145e0","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"キャッシュレスは送金と決済があるけど\n送金のほうが手数料安いしトラブル起きにくいのよね","ts":"1625745138.211200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"do+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2b3235d6-a84b-40c2-abdc-c3b9e51dff56","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあ、良さそうに見える国でゆるゆるでアレな事件が裏で、みたいに思われるくらいなら厳しいほうがいいかな...と思ったり","ts":"1625744118.210500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eQWz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5a2d304f-4c34-42eb-9f2c-903914dc994a","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"確かに審査とか免許とかめんどくさそう","ts":"1625742662.209800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sLS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"84bcb5ba-57be-4185-9f96-5874663d3a3a","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"正確には「銀行が絡む送金システムなど」ですが。","ts":"1625742619.209300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5gve"}]},{"client_msg_id":"83fb3787-3ad0-4e4a-9256-671818e7fe9c","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"日本の銀行システムって法的にガチガチなので一から作るより買収した方がコストがかからないんですよ。","ts":